.TH TEXT_DRAW_DEBUG 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
text_draw_debug \- Draw with the built\-in 8x8 font regardless of TTF availability
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtext.h\(dq
.BI "void text_draw_debug(float x, float y, Color color, const char *s);"
